{"seq":1,"slug":"hotel-operations","title":"大学旅游管理 — 酒店运营与收益管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management/hotel-operations","wordCount":1750,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学旅游管理-酒店运营与收益管理\">大学旅游管理 — 酒店运营与收益管理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>酒店是旅游产业链中最重要的环节之一，也是&quot;管理&quot;二字体现得最充分的领域。一家酒店的运营涉及前厅、客房、餐饮、销售、财务、人力等多个部门的精密协作，目标是在控制成本的同时最大化收入和宾客满意度。酒店业是典型的服务密集、资产密集、运营复杂的行业。</p>\n<p>酒店运营有两个永恒的核心指标：出租率（Occupancy）和平均房价（ADR）。把这两者结合起来的综合指标 RevPAR（每间可售房收入）是衡量酒店经营水平的&quot;金标准&quot;。理解这几个指标的关系，是看懂酒店生意的钥匙。</p>\n<p>由于酒店客房具有&quot;不可储存&quot;的特性（今晚卖不掉就永久损失），酒店业发展出了精密的收益管理（Revenue Management）体系——通过动态定价，在正确的时间、以正确的价格、把房间卖给正确的客人。本课时将讲解酒店运营的核心指标和收益管理的逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"酒店的组织与运营\">酒店的组织与运营</h3><p>一家典型的全服务酒店分为几大运营板块：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部门</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>收入/成本属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前厅部</td>\n<td>预订、入住、退房、宾客关系</td>\n<td>创收核心、第一印象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客房部</td>\n<td>清洁、布草、维护</td>\n<td>成本中心、品质保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>餐饮部</td>\n<td>餐厅、宴会、客房送餐</td>\n<td>重要收入来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销售市场部</td>\n<td>拓客、企业协议、OTA 对接</td>\n<td>创收引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后勤支持</td>\n<td>工程、财务、人力、安保</td>\n<td>成本中心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>酒店运营的特点是&quot;24 小时不间断、需求高度波动、服务即时交付不可返工&quot;。客人对服务的感知极其敏感——一个微笑或一次延误，都直接影响满意度和复购。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心经营指标\">核心经营指标</h3><p>酒店经营有三个环环相扣的核心指标：</p>\n<p><strong>出租率（Occupancy Rate）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Occ</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>已售客房数</mtext><mtext>可售客房数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Occ} = \\frac{\\text{已售客房数}}{\\text{可售客房数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Occ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可售客房数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已售客房数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>平均房价（ADR, Average Daily Rate）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ADR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>客房总收入</mtext><mtext>已售客房数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ADR} = \\frac{\\text{客房总收入}}{\\text{已售客房数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ADR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已售客房数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">客房总收入</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>每间可售房收入（RevPAR, Revenue Per Available Room）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RevPAR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Occ</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>ADR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>客房总收入</mtext><mtext>可售客房数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RevPAR} = \\text{Occ} \\times \\text{ADR} = \\frac{\\text{客房总收入}}{\\text{可售客房数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RevPAR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Occ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ADR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可售客房数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">客房总收入</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>RevPAR 之所以是&quot;金标准&quot;，是因为它综合了&quot;卖了多少&quot;和&quot;卖了多少钱&quot;。举例：一家有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 间房的酒店，某天卖出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>160</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">160</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span></span></span></span></span> 间，客房收入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80000</span></span></span></span></span> 元。则出租率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 160/200 = 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160/200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，ADR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>80000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>160</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 80000/160 = 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80000/160</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 元，RevPAR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 80\\% \\times 500 = 400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> 元。</p>\n<p>理解 RevPAR 揭示了酒店经营的核心权衡：<strong>该追求高出租率（薄利多销）还是高房价（量少价高）？</strong> 答案取决于市场。降价能提升出租率，但若降幅过大，RevPAR 反而下降；提价能拉高 ADR，但若客人流失太多，RevPAR 同样受损。优秀的酒店经营者，追求的是 RevPAR 最大化，而非单一指标最优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"收益管理-动态定价的艺术\">收益管理：动态定价的艺术</h3><p>收益管理（Revenue Management，也叫 Yield Management）源于航空业，核心思想是：在容量固定、产品不可储存、需求波动的条件下，通过动态调整价格和库存控制，实现总收入最大化。</p>\n<p>酒店收益管理的关键策略包括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需求预测] --&gt; B[动态定价]&#10;    B --&gt; C[库存控制]&#10;    C --&gt; D[渠道管理]&#10;    D --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[需求预测] --&gt; B[动态定价]\n    B --&gt; C[库存控制]\n    C --&gt; D[渠道管理]\n    D --&gt; A</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>需求预测</strong>：基于历史数据、预订进度、节假日、会展活动等预测未来的需求。预测越准，定价越优。</li>\n<li><strong>动态定价</strong>：旺季提价、淡季降价；预订早提供低价、临近日期视情况提价或甩卖。同一间房，不同时间、不同渠道、不同客人，价格可能差几倍。</li>\n<li><strong>库存控制</strong>：为高价值客人（如长住、企业协议客）保留房间，限制低价房的数量。比如预测周末会有大量高价散客，就提前关闭低价的提前预订名额。</li>\n<li><strong>渠道管理</strong>：协调直销（官网、会员）和分销（OTA）的价格与库存。原则是尽量引导客人到佣金低的直销渠道。平台与供应商围绕佣金和流量的完整博弈，见<a href=\"travel-agency-ota\">旅行社与在线旅游平台</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个经典的收益管理决策：周五晚上预计需求旺盛，是否要接受一个旅行团的低价批量预订？如果接受，房间被锁定为低价；如果拒绝并赌散客高价需求，可能赚更多，但也可能空房。这种&quot;确定的低收益&quot;与&quot;不确定的高收益&quot;之间的权衡，正是收益管理的精髓。</p>\n<h3 id=\"宾客体验与服务质量\">宾客体验与服务质量</h3><p>再精密的定价，也要建立在好的服务之上。酒店业用&quot;服务质量差距模型&quot;（SERVQUAL）分析服务短板，强调缩小&quot;顾客期望&quot;与&quot;实际感知&quot;之间的差距。同时，会员体系和忠诚度计划（如万豪、希尔顿、华住会）是酒店锁定客户、降低 OTA 依赖的核心武器——会员直订不仅省了佣金，还沉淀了客户数据，能做精准营销。这呼应了<a href=\"../tourism-fundamentals/tourism-industry-structure\">旅游产业结构与参与者</a>讲过的酒店与 OTA 之间的&quot;客户争夺战&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 间房的酒店，某天卖出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>210</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">210</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">210</span></span></span></span></span> 间，客房收入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>147000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">147000</span></span></span></span></span> 元。计算出租率、ADR 和 RevPAR。</li>\n<li>为什么 RevPAR 比单独看出租率或房价更能反映酒店经营水平？请举一个&quot;高出租率但低 RevPAR&quot;的例子。</li>\n<li>收益管理为什么最早出现在航空业和酒店业？这两个行业有什么共同的产品特性？</li>\n<li>站在酒店经营者的角度，你会如何引导客人从 OTA 转向官网直订？会员体系在其中起什么作用？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解航空业的收益管理历史，理解动态定价如何从航空业扩散到酒店、租车、演出票务等领域。</li>\n<li>研究华住、锦江等中国本土酒店集团的会员体系，理解&quot;会员直订&quot;的商业逻辑。</li>\n<li>阅读 SERVQUAL 服务质量差距模型，理解服务质量是如何被测量和改进的。</li>\n<li>关注&quot;酒店刺客&quot;现象（旺季房价暴涨），从收益管理角度思考其合理性与争议。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课时讲解了酒店运营与收益管理。我们梳理了酒店的部门分工和运营特点，重点掌握了出租率、ADR、RevPAR 三大核心指标及其关系，理解了 RevPAR 揭示的&quot;出租率 vs 房价&quot;权衡，并系统学习了收益管理的需求预测、动态定价、库存控制、渠道管理四大策略。核心认知是：酒店生意的本质是在容量固定、产品不可储存的约束下，通过动态定价和优质服务把 RevPAR 做到最大。下一课时，我们将看向另一类重要参与者——旅行社与在线旅游平台。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学旅游管理 — 酒店运营与收益管理","id":"大学旅游管理-酒店运营与收益管理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"酒店的组织与运营","id":"酒店的组织与运营"},{"level":3,"text":"核心经营指标","id":"核心经营指标"},{"level":3,"text":"收益管理：动态定价的艺术","id":"收益管理-动态定价的艺术"},{"level":3,"text":"宾客体验与服务质量","id":"宾客体验与服务质量"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学旅游管理 — 可持续旅游与生态旅游","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/sustainable-ecotourism"},"next":{"title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅行社与在线旅游平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management/travel-agency-ota"}}